  "description": "<p>Experience celestial magic with the Astronaut Galaxy Star Projector night light, designed to bring a calming starry sky ambiance to any room. This projector features an astronaut theme, blending space charm with soft rotating nebula and star patterns for a relaxing atmosphere perfect for bedrooms, kids' rooms, or modern home decor.</p><h2>Key features</h2><ul>\n<li>Astronaut-inspired galaxy and nebula projections for a unique cosmic experience</li>\n<li>Rotating starry sky effect to create a soothing nighttime environment</li>\n<li>Remote control equipped allowing effortless mode and brightness changes</li>\n<li>USB powered for convenient and flexible use</li>\n<li>Compact design ideal for tabletops in bedrooms and living spaces</li>\n<li>Enhances bedtime ambiance and works as a stylish decorative light</li>\n<li>Perfect gift option for kids and space enthusiasts</li>\n</ul><h2>Materials &amp; care</h2><p>Constructed with durable materials ensuring long-lasting use. Wipe clean with a dry cloth to maintain the projector’s finish. Avoid exposure to water or harsh chemicals.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><dl>\n<dt>Q1: What is the Astronaut Galaxy Star Projector?</dt>\n<dd>A: It is a night light projector featuring astronaut-themed galaxy and nebula designs that project rotating stars and cosmic lights to create a relaxing ambiance.</dd>\n<dt>Q2: How do I control the projector settings?</dt>\n<dd>A: The projector comes with a remote control to easily adjust lighting modes and brightness levels from a distance.</dd>\n<dt>Q3: What power source does it use?</dt>\n<dd>A: It is USB powered, allowing convenient connection to power banks, adapters, or computer USB ports.</dd>\n<dt>Q4: Is it suitable for kids?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, it is perfect for kids' bedrooms, providing a calming nightlight with fun space themes.</dd>\n<dt>Q5: Can it be used as a decorative light?</dt>\n<dd>A: Absolutely, its unique astronaut design and starry effects enhance any home decor with a cosmic touch.</dd>\n</dl>\n<!-- dims:start -->\n<div class=\"product-dimensions\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong>Product Dimensions</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Length</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">10 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Width</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">13 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Height</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">8 cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f9f9f9\"><strong>Weight</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px 10px;border:1px solid #ddd\">239 g</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- dims:end -->",
